{"site":"investing.com","doc":"docs/HISTORY/investing.com.md","events":[{"k":"Founding","y":"2007","t":"Founded: 2007-08","s":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16849546"},{"k":"Founding","t":"Founders (public figures only): unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Founding","y":"1996","t":"First archived copy: 1996-12-26","s":"https://web.archive.org/web/19961226020822/http://investing.com:80/"},{"k":"Ownership","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2007","t":"2007: \"The company was founded in 2007 by Israeli entrepreneur Dror Efrat, Russian entrepreneur Lonny Szneiberg and two other co-founders, initially under the name Forexpros.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2008","t":"2008: \"During 2008–2009, more editions were added, and the platform expanded its offering from Forex data to encompass other financial instruments.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2008","t":"2008: \"The company grew rapidly; Globes later attributed part of its growth to the 2008 financial crisis and heightened market volatility.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2012","t":"2012: \"As of Q2 2012 Forexpros had 2.7 million unique visitors and 35 million pageviews per month, and a headcount of 70.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2012","t":"2012: \"The company purchased its current domain, Investing.com, for $2.45 million in December 2012 in one of the most expensive domain-name sales at the time.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2013","t":"2013: \"Investing.com's Android app was launched in September 2013, while an iOS version of the app was launched a year later.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2017","t":"2017: \"Investing.com launched a new version of its cryptocurrency app in 2017.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2018","t":"2018: \"In April 2018, Mickey Winitsky replaced Itay Gissin as CEO.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2018","t":"2018: \"Winitsky announced an expansion strategy for 2018–19.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Key milestones","y":"2018","t":"2018: \"In July 2018, Investing.com signed a memorandum of understanding with TokenPost, a cryptocurrency news website in South Korea.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Ownership changes, pivots and shutdowns","y":"2012","t":"2012: \"In late 2012, ForexPros was rebranded Investing.com.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Ownership changes, pivots and shutdowns","y":"2021","t":"2021: \"In 2021, the company was acquired by Hong Kong–based Joffre Capital for $500 million.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Ownership changes, pivots and shutdowns","y":"","t":"\"AllRates, launched a year earlier, was merged into Investing Money.\"","s":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Investing.com#History"},{"k":"Peak traffic","y":"2020","t":"Best traffic rank recorded on Wikidata: 185 (2020-10-17), the best of 1 recorded ranks (Alexa)","s":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16849546"},{"k":"Notable features","t":"unknown (no source found yet); see the site's feature inventory in docs/PARITY/investing.com.md when it has one.","u":1},{"k":"Controversies","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1},{"k":"Press","t":"unknown (no source found yet)","u":1}],"snaps":[["1996","https://web.archive.org/web/19961226020822/http://investing.com:80/"],["1997","https://web.archive.org/web/19970220204831/http://investing.com:80/"],["1998","https://web.archive.org/web/19980110042515/http://investing.com:80/"],["1999","https://web.archive